  "description": "A world where games have become reality. \n\nThe students are passionate about the running action game 'Food Runner', which runs through the cafeteria every lunch hour. But for Minho, a game shuttle, lunchtime is hell every day... \n\nThen, Saena, the server operator of the Lunch Runner, appeared in front of Minho's suggestion. \n\n*“If you clear the quest, I will free you from the game shuttle.”* \n\nMinho's fierce race for freedom begins!!!",
